text = "Original 3D assets: Nova, drones, golden seeds and night courtyards.\nOcean boat: Kenney Watercraft Kit · Dolphin: Quaternius Fish Pack — CC0\nGarden models: Kenney Nature Kit — CC0 (kenney.nl/assets/nature-kit)\n\nSound effects: Kenney Interface Sounds — CC0\nTypeface: Nunito — SIL Open Font License 1.1\nSensory sounds: alex36917, Luftrum (CC BY 4.0), SDLx (CC BY 3.0)\nCC0 sounds: kvgarlic, AntumDeluge, Tozan, Joseph SARDIN\nAudio edits: Porrumentzio; full sources in docs/SENSORY_GAMES.md\n\nCognitive games are practice, not a validated medical treatment.\nSource links and licenses: docs/ASSET_CREDITS.md"

